@host = http://localhost:8080

### Liveness probe (always 200 if process is running)
GET {{host}}/health/live

### Readiness probe (checks downstream dependencies)
GET {{host}}/health/ready

### Process payment (50/50 success or gateway timeout)
GET {{host}}/process

### Create order - valid
POST {{host}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "item": "widget",
  "quantity": 3,
  "customer": "cust_456"
}

### Create order - invalid body
POST {{host}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json

not json

### Forced error
GET {{host}}/error

### Trigger panic (tests Recoverer middleware)
GET {{host}}/panic
